      "content": "thanks. i think i'm already there though. i've been sitting in the gray for weeks. i was thinking about how some of the most powerful art comes from a place of total destruction... like, what if the music isn't about the emptiness, but about actually succumbing to it? that kind of total surrender. it feels more honest than trying to fake my way through a song about being sad.",
